OL,3,GNEWSAScottish government 'will do all
OL,4,Ait can' to secure Syngenta site's
OL,5,Afuture
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Scottish government said it will do
OL,8,F"all it can" to secure the future of
OL,9,Fchemical firm Syngenta's Grangemouth
OL,10,Fplant after the company announced plans
OL,11,Fto close the site.
OL,13,FEconomy Secretary Stephen Flynn told
OL,14,FMSPs he was "profoundly" disappointed
OL,15,Fat the firm's announcement last week,
OL,16,Fwhich has put almost 400 jobs at risk.
OL,18,FIt later emerged Syngenta collected #1m
OL,19,Fof Scottish Enterprise funding to
OL,20,Fcreate new jobs but it has pledged to
OL,21,Fpay the money back if the site closes.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
