OL,3,GNEWSAScottish government 'will do all
OL,4,Ait can' to secure Syngenta site's
OL,5,Afuture
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlynn said that neither the Scottish or
OL,8,FUK governments were informed of the
OL,9,FSyngenta board's proposal on the site's
OL,10,Ffuture ahead of last week's
OL,11,Fannouncement.
